<title>FINLAND: FISKARS JAN-SEPT PROFIT RISES 22 PCT.</title>
<headline>FISKARS JAN-SEPT PROFIT RISES 22 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax     179 vs 147</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		  14.50 vs 12.70</p>
<p> Net sales					  1,584 vs 1,712</p>
<p> Operating profit				   177 vs 173</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' median forecast for Finnish durable</p>
<p>consumer goods group Fiskars Oy Ab's profit was 185 million</p>
<p>markka (mean 189 million markka) in a 168-209 million markka</p>
<p>range.</p>
<p> Net financial items			charge 30 vs 53 charge</p>
<p> Net extraordinary items		   gain 647 vs 40 gain</p>
<p> Profit before taxes				825 vs 187</p>
<p> Taxes						  244 vs 63</p>
<p> Net profit					   581 vs 125</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)		57 vs 42</p>
<p>NOTE - Company's full name is Fiskars Oy Ab.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 0 6805 0245</p>
